VAD

This distribution includes a modified training runtime derived from:

Vision-OPD
https://github.com/VisionOPD/Vision-OPD

verl
https://github.com/volcengine/verl

The official benchmark implementation under
evaluation/vision_opd_official is derived from the Vision-OPD evaluation
pipeline at commit c2e345f and retains its scoring order:
